{"id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-glb-logic.md","title":"The Bimodal Logic GLB","display":"df-glb-logic — The Bimodal Logic GLB","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-glb-logic","aliases":["89-df-glb-logic"],"display":"df-glb-logic — The Bimodal Logic GLB","depends_on":["[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-glb-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-glb-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-glb-logic — The Bimodal Logic GLB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>；命题重言式以本语言的字母与盒公式为原子，用下式布尔递归定义。公理集与定理集不预先假设存在，均由所列集合构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glb\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\Box_iA\\mid i\\in\\{0,1\\},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&amp;\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}),\\quad v_e(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\nv_e(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\land B)\\coloneqq v_e(A)v_e(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{0,1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\nK_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_i(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box_iA\\to\\Box_iB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\nL_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_i(\\Box_iA\\to A)\\to\\Box_iA\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\n\nE&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{0,1}\\cup K_0\\cup K_1\\cup L_0\\cup L_1\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\cup\\{\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1A,\\ \n\\neg\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GLB}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\nE\\subseteq X,\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\land\\forall A\\in X(\\Box_0A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glb\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\Box_iA\\mid i\\in\\{0,1\\},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&amp;\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}),\\quad v_e(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\nv_e(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\land B)\\coloneqq v_e(A)v_e(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{0,1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\nK_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_i(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box_iA\\to\\Box_iB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\nL_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_i(\\Box_iA\\to A)\\to\\Box_iA\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\n\nE&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{0,1}\\cup K_0\\cup K_1\\cup L_0\\cup L_1\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\cup\\{\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1A,\\ \n\\neg\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GLB}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\nE\\subseteq X,\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\land\\forall A\\in X(\\Box_0A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 188；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n按全部有限 MP、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0\">\\(\\Box_0\\)</span> 必然化应用理解闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_1\">\\(\\Box_1\\)</span> 必然化为派生规则：先推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0A\">\\(\\Box_0A\\)</span>，再以交互公理推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_1A\">\\(\\Box_1A\\)</span>。第六模式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0A\">\\(\\neg\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0A\\)</span>；它不是单纯重复第一交互公理。原书将第二盒记成内部带“1”的盒。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bimodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glb\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\Box_iA\\mid i\\in\\{0,1\\},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}),\\quad v_e(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\nv_e(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\land B)\\coloneqq v_e(A)v_e(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{0,1}&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{0,1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\nK_i&\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_i(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box_iA\\to\\Box_iB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\nL_i&\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_i(\\Box_iA\\to A)\\to\\Box_iA\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\n\nE&\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{0,1}\\cup K_0\\cup K_1\\cup L_0\\cup L_1\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\cup\\{\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1A,\\ \n\\neg\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GLB}&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\nE\\subseteq X,\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\land\\forall A\\in X(\\Box_0A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_1A","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box_0A\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0A","display":false}],"bytes":1978,"backlinks":[{"id":"8de2ffea9eb2c928","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d60c56f59d86adad","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0dd13695a736e1f7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。"},{"id":"ab1164e8495d4ee1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。"},{"id":"6e228478af514c07","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。"},{"id":"0413066aa327a245","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"15ef78b25d5206a3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。"},{"id":"34a172f6f4cae8dd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。"},{"id":"fb1c292712c7fb27","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。"},{"id":"cc787cdf3049271e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}$ 与 $\\mathrm{GLP}$ 分别取 [[89-df-glb-logic]]、[[89-df-glp-logic]] 的定理集。"},{"id":"bb08f01f5311762f",